PARTTYPE
RZ7899-MS
DESCRIPTION
DC bidirectional motor driver chip in an SOP8 package, with 6A max output current, 3.0-30V operating voltage, ultra-low on-resistance, 1UA quiescent current, over-temperature protection, short-circuit protection, overcurrent protection, emergency stop and more. Thanks to its excellent performance, it is widely used to drive DC motors in robots, drones, smart home devices, power tools, personal mobility devices, toys and all kinds of automation control systems.
